From 7ebe0be6b77e840162996561f41d257b7c1c4049 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 18:43:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] chore: Migrate tbump configuration to pyproject.toml

* Move the tbump configuration from tbump.toml to the [tool.tbump] table
  of pyproject.toml and remove tbump.toml. The self-referencing file entry
  now points at pyproject.toml, keeping the search restriction so only the
  tbump git message template line is bumped.
* Read the release version from [tool.tbump.version] in
  ci/validate-version.py and the release-tag workflow.
* Update the release docs, release workflow PR body, and release checklist
  issue template to refer to pyproject.toml.

Closes #2123
